type: software
title: "mdkv"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/mdkv"
abstract: "Python library and CLI for .mdkv, a ZIP container that packs multilingual layered Markdown into one file — seven track types (primary, translation, commentary, code, reference, media_ref, revision) with a YAML manifest, plus regex search, diff, stats, and deterministic filtered HTML/Markdown export. FastAPI GUI included."
